<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications rose 6.5 percent in the week ended March 14, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages rose 4.4 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages increased 7.2 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index rose  4.4 percent to 416.2 from 398.7 the previous week.</p>
<p>The purchase index rose 7.4 percent to 189.0 in the latest survey from 176.0 in the previous week.  </p>
